    "lw address, memory value and writeback are distinct",
    "sw ALU immediate and memory write source are distinct",
    "Both beq paths select correct next PC without state writes",
    "Five-op control rows match independently specified expectations",
    "Differential architecture versus existing model input 0",
    "Differential architecture versus existing model input 5",
    "Differential architecture versus existing model input 9",
    "Differential architecture versus existing model input 2147483647",
    "Differential architecture versus existing model input 4294967294",
    "Unsupported sub and reserved load reject before changing architecture",
    "Misaligned load rejects without a partial register write",
    "x0 writes are discarded and old operands are used",
    "Single-cycle path and unit calculations",
    "Multicycle schedule time, CPI and branch base arithmetic",
    "Host target explicitly differs from RISC-V",
    "C17 two-file sum compile and execute O0",
    "C17 pointer value/store distinction O0",
